    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n20226" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">hărēnātus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aren-</span></b> ), a,
